{"reference":"Jeremiah 17","book":"Jeremiah","chapter":17,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"interpretive_questions","title":"A First-Person Lament","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Verses 14–18 shift into a personal prayer: the speaker asks for healing and rescue, answers those demanding that the word of the LORD be fulfilled, and pleads for protection from persecutors. Passages of this kind are commonly called Jeremiah’s “confessions,” a label for first-person laments that can include protest, isolation, petition, and despair. The label can help readers notice the intensity of this prayer, though scholars dispute both the precise boundaries of these passages and how directly they disclose the prophet’s biography.","verse_refs":["Jeremiah 17:14-18"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_jeremiah_017_cfadfbfdc2573d4ebb47d853"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]},{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"The Book Around This Chapter","blocks":[{"id":"block_2","text":"Jeremiah belongs to a book that combines poetic speech, prose sermons, narratives, letters, headings, repeated accounts, restoration material, oracles concerning nations, and an appendix. This varied shape reflects a long compositional and textual history, whose details remain disputed. Jeremiah 17 itself illustrates that variety by moving from poetic warnings and prayers to a prose instruction delivered at Jerusalem’s gates.","verse_refs":["Jeremiah 10:1-25","Jeremiah 11:1-23","Jeremiah 12:1-17","Jeremiah 13:1-27","Jeremiah 14:1-22","Jeremiah 15:1-21","Jeremiah 16:1-21","Jeremiah 18:1-23","Jeremiah 19:1-15","Jeremiah 1:1-19","Jeremiah 20:1-18","Jeremiah 21:1-14","Jeremiah 22:1-30","Jeremiah 23:1-40","Jeremiah 24:1-10","Jeremiah 25:1-38","Jeremiah 26:1-24","Jeremiah 27:1-22","Jeremiah 28:1-17","Jeremiah 29:1-32","Jeremiah 2:1-37","Jeremiah 30:1-24","Jeremiah 31:1-40","Jeremiah 32:1-44","Jeremiah 33:1-26","Jeremiah 34:1-22","Jeremiah 35:1-19","Jeremiah 36:1-32","Jeremiah 37:1-21","Jeremiah 38:1-28","Jeremiah 39:1-18","Jeremiah 3:1-25","Jeremiah 40:1-16","Jeremiah 41:1-18","Jeremiah 42:1-22","Jeremiah 43:1-13","Jeremiah 44:1-30","Jeremiah 45:1-5","Jeremiah 46:1-28","Jeremiah 47:1-7","Jeremiah 48:1-47","Jeremiah 49:1-39","Jeremiah 4:1-31","Jeremiah 50:1-46","Jeremiah 51:1-64","Jeremiah 52:1-34","Jeremiah 5:1-31","Jeremiah 6:1-30","Jeremiah 7:1-34","Jeremiah 8:1-22","Jeremiah 9:1-26"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_jeremiah_017_e728314e03efccc6e84b295f"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}